    {
      "name": "places/ChIJK3xb0mDzaS4RyQOmsFcW-_M/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoaElxQ3lRRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "A Turkish patisserie in East Jakarta. I love their kunafe and tea very much. Because I'm not a sweet tooth person, I don't like their baklava (hence it is too sweet). Also, the car parking area is not big",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "A Turkish patisserie in East Jakarta. I love their kunafe and tea very much. Because I'm not a sweet tooth person, I don't like their baklava (hence it is too sweet). Also, the car parking area is not big",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
